{"id":173350728,"slug":"in-other-news-more-people-are-shot","title":"In Other News, More People Are Shot to Death","subtitle":"The public health crisis we don't care to solve","post_date":"2025-09-12T12:50:23.979Z","audience":"everyone","type":"newsletter","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/in-other-news-more-people-are-shot","wordcount":932,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:46:16.859Z","body_sha256":"5019f23feaa75c322a40591393649f5a2045f1129a420b0a2eff5dc6f53ef06e","text_words":931,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p>Being shot to death is the leading cause of death among children in America. He’s a map of just shootings with a child involved...</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!nlQk!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F80fda5a4-bae0-4a1b-a601-664c192418f3_1544x1140.heic\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!nlQk!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F80fda5a4-bae0-4a1b-a601-664c192418f3_1544x1140.heic 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!nlQk!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F80fda5a4-bae0-4a1b-a601-664c192418f3_1544x1140.heic 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!nlQk!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F80fda5a4-bae0-4a1b-a601-664c192418f3_1544x1140.heic 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!nlQk!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F80fd