w\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>And to remind us all how many school shootings there are, and what the trend looks like, here is a graph from the <a href=\"https://k12ssdb.org/all-shootings#\">K-12 shooting database</a>:</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xIe4!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F24056c7d-831f-42b1-ae0b-cc779e2ea753_1758x1140.heic\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xIe4!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F24056c7d-831f-42b1-ae0b-cc779e2ea753_1758x1140.heic 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xIe4!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F24056c7d-831f-42b1-ae0b-cc779e2ea753_1758x1140.heic 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xIe4!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F24056c7d-831f-42b1-ae0b-cc779e2ea753_1758x1140.heic 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xIe4!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F24056c7d-831f-42b1-ae0b-cc779e2ea753_1758x1140.heic 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xIe4!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F24056c7d-831f-42b1-ae0b-cc779e2ea753_1758x1140.heic\" width=\"543\" height=\"352.05494505494505\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/24056c7d-831f-42b1-ae0b-cc779e2ea753_1758x1140.heic&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:944,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:543,&quot;bytes&quot;:82329,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/heic&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/i/173350728?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F24056c7d-831f-42b1-ae0b-cc779e2ea753_1758x1140.heic&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xIe4!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F24056c7d-831f-42b1-ae0b-cc779e2ea753_1758x1140.heic 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xIe4!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F24056c7d-831f-42b1-ae0b-cc779e2ea753_1758x1140.heic 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xIe4!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F24056c7d-831f-42b1-ae0b-cc779e2ea753_1758x1140.heic 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xIe4!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F24056c7d-831f-42b1-ae0b-cc779e2ea753_1758x1140.heic 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>In case it’s not clear, the numbers are going up.  The late Mr. Kirk was a master debater (recently parodied—<a href=\"https://churchleaders.com/news/516972-charlie-kirk-praises-south-park-for-parody-of-his-campus-debates-bible-references.html\">with enthusiastic support by Charlie himself</a>— on South Park, and as yesterday ago, <a href=\"https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/charlie-kirk-death-news-south-park-episode-parodying-charlie-kirk-dropped-by-comedy-central-9256415\">pulled off the internet by Paramount</a>), and would often counter questions about gun violence by pointing out that children up to age 24 are <em>barely children at all.</em>  They are still dead, though, after being shot by a gun.</p><p>Mr. Kirk was murdered, with a gun, by what I can only assume is a giant a-hole, on a <em>college</em> campus.  His number <em>won’t be added to that K-12 number</em>.  </p><p>Mr. Kirk was correct to note that the cost of having a well-armed populace is <em>excess deaths</em>. In 2023, at one of his own events, he weighed in on the fact that these deaths are a price <a href=\"https://www.snopes.com/fact-check/charlie-kirk-gun-deaths-quote/\">we should be willing to pay</a>:</p><blockquote><p>Turning Point USA CEO and co-founder Charlie Kirk said of gun deaths on April 5, 2023, \"<strong>I think it's worth it.</strong> I think it's worth to have a cost of, unfortunately, some gun deaths every single year so that we can have the Second Amendment to protect our other God-given rights.\"</p></blockquote><p>To be clear, the only way in which gun ownership protects our other god given rights is by granting anyone with temerity the opportunity to end the lives of those with whom they disagree, absent due process or judicial review.</p><p>I’m not cheering for the death of Mr. Kirk—quite the opposite.  I oppose gun violence. I oppose political violence.  I oppose corporate violence.  This excess death is a bad plan and a bad deal, is my debating point.  Mr. Kirk had every right to advocate for his views.  One of those views is that the following <a href=\"https://www.thetrace.org/2023/02/gun-violence-map-america-shootings/\">map of mass shootings over the past 11 years</a> is a price we get <em>right with god about</em>:</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jOUt!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe182b70e-884b-4c2d-9ecf-4c3c69f3dfa6_1544x1140.heic\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jOUt!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe182b70e-884b-4c2d-9ecf-4c3c69f3dfa6_1544x1140.heic 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jOUt!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe182b70e-884b-4c2d-9ecf-4c3c69f3dfa6_1544x1140.heic 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jOUt!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe182b70e-884b-4c2d-9ecf-4c3c69f3dfa6_1544x1140.heic 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jOUt!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe182b70e-884b-4c2d-9ecf-4c3c69f3dfa6_1544x1140.heic 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jOUt!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe182b70e-884b-4c2d-9ecf-4c3c69f3dfa6_1544x1140.heic\" width=\"1456\" height=\"1075\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/e182b70e-884b-4c2d-9ecf-4c3c69f3dfa6_1544x1140.heic&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1075,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:92106,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/heic&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/i/173350728?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe182b70e-884b-4c2d-9ecf-4c3c69f3dfa6_1544x1140.heic&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jOUt!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe182b70e-884b-4c2d-9ecf-4c3c69f3dfa6_1544x1140.heic 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jOUt!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe182b70e-884b-4c2d-9ecf-4c3c69f3dfa6_1544x1140.heic 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jOUt!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe182b70e-884b-4c2d-9ecf-4c3c69f3dfa6_1544x1140.heic 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jOUt!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe182b70e-884b-4c2d-9ecf-4c3c69f3dfa6_1544x1140.heic 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Mr. Kirk and his co-enthusiasts for the Second Amendment can hold any belief and advocate for it.  Again, Mr. Kirk’s stance:</p><blockquote><p>“<em>I think it's worth</em> to have a cost of, unfortunately, <em>some gun deaths every single year</em> so that we can have the Second Amendment to protect our other God-given rights.\"</p></blockquote><p>As a pediatric subspecialist, I have a different opinion.  I’m not going to shoot you about it—unlike the craven who chose his “rights” over Mr. Kirk’s life— I am going to try to <em>persuade</em> you. </p><p>A comparison might be helpful? Here is the list of every single mass shooting in Japan in the 21st century</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WqaJ!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6f16e0ad-f348-4a95-a235-1592c04638ca_1756x1272.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WqaJ!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6f16e0ad-f348-4a95-a235-1592c04638ca_1756x1272.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WqaJ!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6f16e0ad-f348-4a95-a235-1592c04638ca_1756x1272.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WqaJ!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6f16e0ad-f348-4a95-a235-1592c04638ca_1756x1272.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WqaJ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6f16e0ad-f348-4a95-a235-1592c04638ca_1756x1272.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WqaJ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6f16e0ad-f348-4a95-a235-1592c04638ca_1756x1272.png\" width=\"1456\" heig